  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/505704/diamond-spheres-invention-and-ingenuity?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Invention &amp; Ingenuity</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Herbalism sphere (Emergency Triage), Heal 5 ranks</p>\n<p>You can use the Heal skill on yourself as a free action usable outside of your turn once per round, and doing so requires no physical action or tools. This also allows you to use the Heal skill while unconscious or even dead at a -5 penalty (although you can only use the resuscitate skill use when dead).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/herbalism#toc56\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
